research/audit/wave11-refuter-tasks/thm-second-mean-value-theorem-for-integrals.md-81-[L8] Riemann's criterion for the integrable $f$: for every real $\eta>0$ there is a partition $P$ with $U(f,P)-L(f,P) < \eta$ ([[thm-riemann-criterion]]).
